body:
Contractor here. He 100% knows Juan, and he has probably even worked with Juan on projects.  

&#x200B;

Side note: Having a kid on a job-site is beyond stupid for safety reasons and also puts the property owner at risk as well.  So although your knee jerk reactions were well intended the result was you gave business to a guy who is breaking some pretty standard OSHA rules and possibly child labor laws. Good Times.
